    "body": "### Summary\n\n* Updated `soan-spec` from six to seven repository-specific rules, adding L7 to prohibit soft review budgets and require every owner-directed question to use E1, E2, or E3 with the prescribed evidence. [.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.mdL127-L153](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/83bbb5f79ebcc0c50fc2301f3bc514fbb5aa8673/.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.md#L127-L153)\n* Made the landed `ADR-0055` declaration the default for every new specification, retained the `ADR-0053` declaration for sensitive packets, and documented how conflicting or missing declarations affect the applicable ceiling. [.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.mdL159-L176](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/83bbb5f79ebcc0c50fc2301f3bc514fbb5aa8673/.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.md#L159-L176)\n* Added `tran_*` and `luat_dung` to the required specification output contract so the ADR declaration, E1–E3 classifications, and soft-budget prohibition are explicit. [.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.mdL184-L200](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/83bbb5f79ebcc0c50fc2301f3bc514fbb5aa8673/.claude/skills/soan-spec/SKILL.md#L184-L200)\n* Replaced the zero-gate entries for `ADR-0037`, `ADR-0038`, `ADR-0043`, and `ADR-0048` with measurable enforcement details and explicit remaining gaps. [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL1500-L1501](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/83bbb5f79ebcc0c50fc2301f3bc514fbb5aa8673/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L1500-L1501) [docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.mdL1506-L1511](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/blob/83bbb5f79ebcc0c50fc2301f3bc514fbb5aa8673/docs/PROTOCOL_DA_PHIEN.md#L1506-L1511)\n* Committed the changes as `d73620c9b2bb19c8d12b5c1b37868f3255f4dc44` with tree `9acd42b130ea1acdba31b36a7bb8258d86aca589`, and prepared the required follow-up pull request metadata.\n\n**Testing**\n\n* ✅ `python -B .claude/dev/packet_loop.py doctrine-scan --root .` — scanned 12 files with zero copied-doctrine findings.\n* ✅ `python -B .claude/dev/packet_loop.py adr-song --root .` — confirmed 64 ADR files and 64 corresponding §20 rows.\n* ✅ `python -B scripts/tl.py --selftest` — passed `1777/1777`.\n* ✅ `git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD`\n* ⚠️ `python /tmp/kiem_p1.py ops/specs/GIAM-HOI-P1-SOAN-SPEC-r7.md HEAD^` — correctly returned “KHÔNG ĐO ĐƯỢC: clone shallow”; the checkout has no configured `origin`, so the acceptance script’s required non-shallow history could not be fetched.\n* ⚠️ `git fetch --unshallow origin master` — environment limitation: no `origin` remote is configured.\n\n [View task →](https://chatgpt.com/s/cd_6af6bc58a42481918bd3ae116f1934fc)",
